    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyasi mag turumbete",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\" 'E odiechiengʼ mokwongo mar dwe mar abiriyo losuru chokruok mowal kendo kik uti tijeu mapile. En odiechiengʼ mugoyoe turumbete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chiwuru misango miwangʼo pep mar nyarwath achiel, im achiel kod nyiimbe abiriyo moromo higa achiel, ma duto onge songa mondo obed kaka misango madungʼ tik mangʼwe ngʼar mamoro Jehova Nyasaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwath ka rwath nyaka chiw gi chiwo mar cham maromo kilo apar mar mogo mayom moru gi mo; im to chiw gi kilo abiriyo;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nyiimbe abiriyogo moro ka moro uchiw gi kilo adek.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ewi mago meduru nywok achiel kaka chiwo mar pwodhruok e richo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magi imedo ewi misango miwangʼo pep mar dwe ka dwe kod mago michiwo pile ka pile kaachiel gi chiwo mar cham kod misango miolo piny mana kaka owinjore. Gin chiwo miwangʼo pep ne Jehova Nyasaye, madungʼ tik mangʼwe ngʼar mamoro Jehova Nyasaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Odiechiengʼ mar pwodhruok",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\" 'E odiechiengʼ mar apar mar dwe mar abiriyo beduru gi chokruok mowal. Nyaka utwe chiemo kulamo kendo kik uti tich moro amora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kelneuru Jehova Nyasaye chiwo madungʼ tik mangʼwe ngʼar mar misango miwangʼo pep mar nyarwath, im achiel kod nyiimbe abiriyo ma jo-higa achiel, mago maonge songa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwath ka rwath nyaka chiw gi chiwo mar cham maromo kilo apar mar mogo mayom moruw gi mo; im to uchiw gi kilo abiriyo;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to nyiimbe abiriyo-ka, to uchiw gi kilo adek.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ewi mago meduru nywok achiel kaka chiwo mar pwodhruok e richo, kumedo gi chiwo mar pwodhruok e richo kod misango miwangʼo pep mapile pile mikelo gi chiwo mar cham, kod misango miolo piny.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyasi mag hekalu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\" 'E odiechiengʼ mar apar gabich e dwe mar abiriyo, losuru chokruok mowal kendo kik uti tijeu mapile. Losneuru Jehova Nyasaye sawo kuom ndalo abiriyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kelnauru Jehova Nyasaye chiwo madungʼ tik mangʼwe ngʼar mar misango miwangʼo pep mar rwedhi apar gadek, imbe ariyo kod nyiimbe apar gangʼwen mahikgi achiel, maonge songa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuom rwedhi apar gadekgo kelnauru chiwo mar cham maromo kilo apar mar mogo mayom moru gi mo; kuom imbe ariyogo, chiwuru kilo abiriyo ne moro ka moro;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to kuom nyiimbe apar gangʼwen-ka, to uchiw kilo adek.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ewi mago meduru nywok achiel kaka misango mar pwodhruok e richo, kumedo ewi misango miwangʼo pep mapile kod chiwo mar cham gi misango miolo piny.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\" 'E odiechiengʼ mar ariyo chiwuru nyirwedhi apar gariyo, imbe ariyo kod nyiimbe apar gangʼwen mahikgi achiel, ma duto onge songa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chiwo mag cham kod misango miolo piny nyaka keti kaka chik dwaro maromre gi rwedhigo, imbego kod nyiimbego.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ewi mago meduru nywok achiel kaka chiwo mar pwodhruok e richo, kumedo ewi misango miwangʼo pep mapile kod chiwo mar cham, kaachiel gi misango miolo piny.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\" 'E odiechiengʼ mar adek chiwuru rwedhi apar gachiel, imbe ariyo kod nyiimbe apar gangʼwen ma jo-higa achiel, ma duto onge songa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chiwo mag cham kod misango miolo piny nyaka keti kaka chik dwaro maromre gi rwedhigo, imbego kod nyiimbego.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ewi mago meduru nywok achiel kaka chiwo mar pwodhruok e richo, kumedo ewi misango miwangʼo pep mapile kaachiel gi misango miolo piny.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
