            "sid": "NUM 29:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\" 'E odiechiengʼ mar angʼwen chiwuru rwedhi apar, imbe ariyo kod nyiimbe apar gangʼwen ma jo-higa achiel, ma duto onge songa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chiwo mag cham kod misango miolo piny nyaka keti kaka chik dwaro maromre gi rwedhigo, imbego kod nyiimbego.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ewi mago meduru nywok achiel kaka chiwo mar pwodhruok e richo, kumedo ewi misango miwangʼo pep mapile kaachiel gi chiwo mar cham kaachiel gi misango miolo piny.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
